From: Cheng Li <shiptux@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pvr: add Allwinner A733 to the DRM device table

The A733 carries a BXM-4-64 (BVNC 36.56.104.183) driven by the mainline
powervr DRM driver with compatible "allwinner,a733-gpu". Add it next to
the existing TI/MediaTek entries so the physical device is enumerated.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_instance.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_instance.c
+++ b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_instance.c
@@ -50,6 +50,7 @@
 
 /* This is the list of supported DRM render driver configs. */
 static const struct pvr_drm_device_config pvr_drm_configs[] = {
+   DEF_CONFIG("allwinner,a733-gpu"),
    DEF_CONFIG("mediatek,mt8173-gpu"),
    DEF_CONFIG("ti,am62-gpu"),
    DEF_CONFIG("ti,j721s2-gpu"),
